    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Winner of Best Puzzle Game &amp; Best Storytelling @ Game Connection America 2024)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieced Together is a cozy scrapbooking game that takes you on a heartfelt journey about friendship, getting older and learning to let go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve scrapbook-based puzzles, create beautiful pages and discover a true-to-life story page by page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/0ae182ccf590748ca80e6e8270894058.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/4e4ac5bb6408e4613a018e8c051d8ff5.avif?t=1754244654\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/6730396fedd7a433e993e2bb5d55f1da.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique item sorting and investigation puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cozy scrapbooking gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A heartwarming story of friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stickers to collect and customise the scrapbook with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/8f9360ef1275e94ed0f0bba11e23b90e.avif?t=1754244654\" width=429 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Connie &amp; Beth...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two lifelong friends who met at 11 years old, and have been always been there for each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/acad399f0256590e372bdeacca6a41b9.avif?t=1754244654\" width=517 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now they're in their thirties, something has come between them. It's time for Connie to look back through their friendship and decide - is it worth holding on to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/e2f054c339b1bc4051c7812479c87cc5.avif?t=1754244654\" width=611 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/0732ed423d651eb95426024741e98635.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Winner of Best Puzzle Game &amp; Best Storytelling @ Game Connection America 2024)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieced Together is a cozy scrapbooking game that takes you on a heartfelt journey about friendship, getting older and learning to let go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve scrapbook-based puzzles, create beautiful pages and discover a true-to-life story page by page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/0ae182ccf590748ca80e6e8270894058.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/4e4ac5bb6408e4613a018e8c051d8ff5.avif?t=1754244654\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/6730396fedd7a433e993e2bb5d55f1da.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique item sorting and investigation puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cozy scrapbooking gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A heartwarming story of friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stickers to collect and customise the scrapbook with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/8f9360ef1275e94ed0f0bba11e23b90e.avif?t=1754244654\" width=429 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Connie &amp; Beth...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two lifelong friends who met at 11 years old, and have been always been there for each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/acad399f0256590e372bdeacca6a41b9.avif?t=1754244654\" width=517 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now they're in their thirties, something has come between them. It's time for Connie to look back through their friendship and decide - is it worth holding on to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/e2f054c339b1bc4051c7812479c87cc5.avif?t=1754244654\" width=611 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/0732ed423d651eb95426024741e98635.avif?t=1754244654\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
